Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:30.00,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}それでも良いのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:30.00,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}便無人在意
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.00,0:22:33.71,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}どうしてわかっちゃうの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.00,0:22:33.71,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}為何偏被你撿起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:33.71,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}どうしてわかっちゃうの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:33.71,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}為何偏被你撿起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.25,0:22:41.26,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}あまりに尊いものみたいにそっと
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.25,0:22:41.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}彷若難得一見的珍奇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:41.26,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}あまりに尊いものみたいにそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:41.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}彷若難得一見的珍奇
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.26,0:22:46.72,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}優しい手で触れるから
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.26,0:22:46.72,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}被溫柔的手輕輕觸及
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:46.72,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}優しい手で触れるから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:46.72,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}被溫柔的手輕輕觸及
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.10,0:22:53.48,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}いつか鍵かけたはずの錆びた心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.10,0:22:53.48,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}心門閉鎖後的斑斑鏽跡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:53.48,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}いつか鍵かけたはずの錆びた心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:53.48,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}心門閉鎖後的斑斑鏽跡
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.48,0:23:00.86,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1500)}ゆっくり今開いて行く
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.48,0:23:00.86,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1500)}由此漸漸痕跡消弭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:23:00.86,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1500)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}ゆっくり今開いて行く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:23:00.86,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1500)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}由此漸漸痕跡消弭
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.74,0:23:04.91,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}あなたの背中も
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.74,0:23:04.91,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}無論是你的背影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:04.91,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}あなたの背中も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:04.91,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}無論是你的背影
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.91,0:23:08.37,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}息も言葉も
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.91,0:23:08.37,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}呼吸 還是言語
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.91,0:23:08.37,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}息も言葉も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.91,0:23:08.37,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}呼吸 還是言語
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.66,0:23:13.92,ED_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}私を私にする魔法
